---
source: crates/m2-server-core/tests/mounts.rs
expression: h.log
---
-- talking to the stable: level 1 and what it takes
@1000 conn#4 sends Talk vid=3
   -> send conn#4 StableOpened vid=3 next=level 1 grade 1 look 1201 speed 180 stamina 30 rider 0 gold 100 items [] points 0
-- the first training: 100 gold, the mount's call, the stable again
@1000 conn#4 sends TrainMount vid=3
   -> event: conn#4: character 1 trained its mount to level 1
   -> send conn#4 PointsChanged 11=900
   -> send conn#4 ItemSet 1:0 2001x1
   -> send conn#4 MountState level=1 grade=1 look=1201 stamina=30/30 ride_from=6 fights=false skills=false points=0 summoned=None
   -> send conn#4 StableOpened vid=3 next=level 2 grade 2 look 1202 speed 200 stamina 60 rider 5 gold 500 items [2003x2] points 3
   -> send conn#4 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "You have a mount now: call it with its item."
-- level 2 needs level 5, then 2 hay bales
@1000 conn#4 sends TrainMount vid=3
   -> send conn#4 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "You need level 5 to train your mount."
@1000 conn#4 sends SendChat kind=0 "/level 5"
   -> send conn#4 PointsChanged 1=5 4=5500 5=940 6=940 7=480 8=480 16=8 18=22 20=8 26=12 28=4
   -> send conn#4 EntityEffect kind=2 vid=4
   -> send conn#4 EntityInfo vid=4 alice empire=1 level=5
   -> send conn#4 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "Level 5."
   -> send conn#4 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "You can choose your skills now: /skillgroup 1 or 2"
   -> event: conn#4: game master account 1 on character 1: /level 5
@1000 conn#4 sends TrainMount vid=3
   -> send conn#4 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "You need 2 × Hay Bale."
@1000 conn#4 sends SendChat kind=0 "/item 2003 2"
   -> send conn#4 ItemSet 1:1 2003x2
   -> send conn#4 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "Given 2 of Hay Bale."
   -> event: conn#4: game master account 1 on character 1: /item 2003 2
-- level 2: 500 gold and the hay, 3 horseback skill points; nothing past it
@1000 conn#4 sends TrainMount vid=3
   -> event: conn#4: character 1 trained its mount to level 2
   -> send conn#4 PointsChanged 11=400
   -> send conn#4 ItemSet 1:1 empty
   -> send conn#4 MountState level=2 grade=2 look=1202 stamina=60/60 ride_from=12 fights=true skills=true points=3 summoned=None
   -> send conn#4 StableOpened vid=3 next=none
   -> send conn#4 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "Your mount is now level 2."
@1000 conn#4 sends TrainMount vid=3
   -> send conn#4 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "Your mount cannot be trained any further."
-- ignored: the hopper keeps no stable
@1000 conn#4 sends TrainMount vid=1
-- the mount is saved with the character
@1000 conn#4 closed: the client left
   -> store #8: save #1 at (475000, 966100) played 0s gold=400 items=[0:2001x1] mount=2 stamina=60 mount_points=3
   -> event: conn#4: closed: the client left
@1000 store answers #8: saved: Ok(())
